Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法本来是史上最可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was the biggest monster ever hatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你跟我放出了更可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you and I hatched one that's even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是原初 也将会是终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the beginning, and I will be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be all that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你在夺取他人性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你反抗 天空中的每个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you resist, each and every angel in the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会毁灭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}will smite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的能打败她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you really beat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以 - 那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can. - Then, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 小狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, little puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「上帝之手」 一件超能武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Hand of God" … a super weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们可以用它对付阿玛拉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we can use it against Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦之杖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rod of Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.14,0:00:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hand of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.19,0:00:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要对抗她 有什么武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna fight her, what better way to arm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比他残留的法力更好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}than with an actual dose of his power?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没能量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.45,0:00:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法力了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of juice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没查到任何其他上帝之手的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got jack on another Hand of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.07,0:00:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,救小卡的办法更是没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've got even less jack on how to save Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他想被我们救的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:00:59.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.36,0:01:02.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（沙特阿拉伯 内夫得沙漠）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺埃尔 你找我我就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noel, I came when you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点憔悴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking a trifle peaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的在你这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you truly have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你能遵守约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hold up your end of the bargin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子过得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a good life…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.09,0:02:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要多谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上没几个秘密没被我解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very few of the world's secrets I haven't cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来值得以灵魂交换了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed worth a soul…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少当时我那么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了那玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把东西给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the object first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,羊角号\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shofar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.62,0:02:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚的号角 上帝曾用手碰过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Horn of Joshua, touched by the hand of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那玩意撕毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tear that thing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我时日无多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I have long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真有先见之明\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very prescient of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真业余\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第11季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you not hearing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我手上有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I have in my possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们共同问题的解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}the solution to our collective problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该乐得跳起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be doing a jig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't jig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你真逃出了路西法的魔掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how do I know you even escaped Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他逼你说这些话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's not making you say all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.06,0:05:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 你的愤世嫉俗令人郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, you cynicism is depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法为什么要逼我讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Lucifer force me to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能毁掉他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very means of his destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件武器 蕴含了神力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weapon … one that channels divinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 有足够法力毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, powerful enough to help destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.39,0:05:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗那样的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}a force like the Darkness…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没有在寻找这样的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you haven't been searching for such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝之手吗 当然在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Hand of God? Of course we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.44,0:05:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣路易斯 比克曼街老邮局\N{\fnArial\fs30}St. Louis. The old post office on Beekman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道这会好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know that any of this is working?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说了那么多 我没觉得有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel any different, for all of your promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 你可别想捉弄我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warn you, I'm not one to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时够了 小可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough for now, poor wee thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're coming along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会像说好的那样治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll heal you just as I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能连通自然力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}One who communes with the natural forces and.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以其帮助你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}channels them to help the less fortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}such as yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力叔叔的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Crowley's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还小的时候 他曾试图控制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried controlling me when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.97,0:07:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他派你来带我回去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he send you to bring me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavens, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子和我讨厌彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son and I loathe each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你会赢的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're going to win, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道你和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know about the grievance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥以及他的大天使之间的矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}between you and your brother and his archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟路西法也有账要算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my own ax to grind with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你 我这人能大难不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like yourself, I'm a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,艰辛的生活教会我要做足准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hard life has taught me to be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, long ago, secreted within my person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,存留了一小点强大的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wee casket of powerful magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我体内的咒语感应到我的生命力衰退时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the spell inside me sensed my life-force ebbing…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它便开始起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}it went to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Lucifer now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他躲了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hidden himself from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也有账要算\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I, too, have a score to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你还因讨厌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, you're still weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使攻击而虚弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}from that pesky angel smiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能治好我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can fix that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, and so much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以毁灭你的敌人 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can destroy your enemies and, I imagine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能按你的意愿重塑这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}remake the world any way you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会陪在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I… will be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice digs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,墓穴守卫不在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Crypt Keeper out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着就算走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法把我像狗一样拴在我自己的宫殿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer had me trussed up like a dog in my own palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,「宫殿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Palace"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个废弃的疯人院啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the abandoned nuthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我关在狗舍里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kept me in a kennel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还让他的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he turned all his demons …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的恶魔 与我反目\N{\fnArial\fs30}my demons … against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们日夜不停地到处找我 想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They scour the earth, day and night, looking to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得解决他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我们来就为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is this why you brought us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟路西法赌气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some lousy grudge match with Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你说的那个上帝之手在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where's this, uh, Hand of God you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要说到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们制服阿玛拉的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your only hope of subduing Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是拥有与她相当的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to match the level of power that she possesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是呢 继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No kidding. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有约书亚的号角\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have the Horn of Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,约书亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败了耶律哥的那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in the Joshua that won the battle of Jericho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意将它交给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm willing to entrust it to your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我刚说愿把那东西给你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I just said I'd give you the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 条件呢 - 条件呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If? - If?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就这么说「谢谢」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how you say "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这玩意都长树上的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think these things grow on bloody trees?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,少扯淡了 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the crap, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总会提条件的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you, there's always an "If".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把号角给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you the Horn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们得帮忙把路西法从小卡的皮囊中驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you help me exorcise Lucifer from Castiel's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后马上把他关回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then return him immediately to the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.93,0:10:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,号角在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is this horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然是安全地藏好了 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Safely hidden, naturally. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 就算我们能把路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, even if we could exorcise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小卡体内驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer out of Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼子几乎无法闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Cage is damn near impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.49,0:10:49.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,是靠《诅咒之书》里的咒语才把路西法弄了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took a spell from the Book of the Damned to spring Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜又把书藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Rowena hid the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们需要书加上她 才有一线希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we would need both the book and her to even have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有说这事会很简单了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say this would be easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道罗威娜在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know where Rowena is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪发霉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotting somewhere, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法扭断了她的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer snapped her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔菲尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jofiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it hangin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}So perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 天堂头号通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, one of heaven's most wanted,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被天堂第一公敌附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}possessed by heaven's most hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想再次加入大家的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be a part of the action again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想帮把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想合击杀黑暗没有成功啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, trying to smite the Darkness was a bust, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有整个天堂的力量支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had all of the power of heaven behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.56,0:12:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,却还是无法拖慢她一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't even slow the bitch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必觉得自己像个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no need to feel like abject losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们吸取了宝贵教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}You learned a valuable lesson here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有充满敬畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not giddy with awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把乔菲尔弄爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}exploded Jofiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是乔菲尔自爆了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did Jofiel explode himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,随口一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝把你驱逐出了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}God cast you out of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁到处散播这条小报新闻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who do you think spread that tabloid headline?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是G船长 永生者\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Captain G, the Eternal One.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.51,0:13:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't buy in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他一样 对人类有执迷的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to his obsessive-compulsive love for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类是他的创造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind is his creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不是发明了普锐斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like he invented the Prius,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车还挺不错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}which actually works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用告诉你们人类是多么完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to tell you people what a mess mankind is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞勒姆女巫审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Salem Witch Trials…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Third Reich…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,双子塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Twin Towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 偶尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, sure, every once in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会降临个瘟疫 教训他们一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll send down a little plague to straighten them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但从不是根本的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's nothing permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.84,0:13:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类创造了广岛 然后又毁掉重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity brought us Hiroshima and got a redo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是质疑了他对轻重的判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I merely questioned His priorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就被踢走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got the boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你是邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you're evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}E-Evil incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是营销\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's marketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在消费者心里埋下了需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's creating a need in the consumer's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有超级坏蛋 就没有超级救星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't be a Super Savior if you don't have a Super Villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you offering?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决这窘境的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, a way out of this pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「窘境」是指黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By "pickle, " you mean the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能跟她讲理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can reason with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恐怕不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以把她关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can lock her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是永远关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前也干过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事老爸没说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pops didn't tell you that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉她之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}gotten rid of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll want…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想\N{\fnArial\fs30}to…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay around?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I like the way you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, am I jazzed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you comfy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以叫我上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}could call me God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先倒回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just put it in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把路西法关回笼子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will put Lucifer back in the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要先把阿玛拉关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}after we put Amara back on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须是这个先后顺序 否则路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to happen in that order, otherwise there is no Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼子 一切都要消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no Cage, there's no nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.67,0:15:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他多年来一直恨着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's spent years marinating in hate against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须除掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 我们可能需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem is, we may need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟阿玛拉斗过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been down this road with Amara before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许是唯一有能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be the only one powerful enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用号角对付她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to use the Horn against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我清洁地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me cleaning the floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.48,0:15:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,用舌头舔\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喊我「狗狗」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He called me "puppy"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他逼我求他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:15:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的破自尊心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stupid ego?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他当着一群小破恶魔的面羞辱了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that he dissed you in front of a bunch of stupid demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那么笨的 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smarter than this. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,得先把号角给路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Priority is to put the Horn in Lucifer's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.89,0:16:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去对付阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set him loose on Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要先把路西法从小卡身体里驱逐出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we exorcise Lucifer out of Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把他放进新皮囊里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put him into a new vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 当然啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能派路西法穿着小卡上战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna send Lucifer into battle inside Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他死了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he doesn't make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那是个强大的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's a strong vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他支撑了小卡那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's held Cass for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道他都经历了多少事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know what he's been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜它也能支撑路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing it can hold Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是「它」 萨姆 那是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an "it, " Sam. It's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小卡想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Cass wanted to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有时候我还想要戴佐罗面具的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, there's times I want to get slapped during sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在做爱时打我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a girl wearing a Zorro mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表那就是个好主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't make it a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.13,0:16:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们就是这样坑了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is exactly how we screw ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总做情绪化的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-We make the … the heart choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是明智的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of the smart choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 菲尔医生 多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. Thank you, Dr. Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们应该尊重他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and his choice deserves to be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他因此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it kills him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们简直要我命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可往眼睛里插一根火热的叉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather stick white-hot skewers in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不想再听你俩小碎嘴吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than listen to you two bitches bicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:16:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把条件都说清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you the terms of my deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer's not back in the Cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别指望拿到号角\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Horn stays hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮囊恢复得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vessel is healing nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能重焕精神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon you'll be shipshape and Bristol fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎对我的进展很满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem pleased with my progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得你似乎做不到善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't sense in you the capacity for kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或关切\N{\fnArial\fs30}or…concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,善良只能帮你赚到一个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindness gets you a hug,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不能让你当上重要人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a seat at the big boys' table.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你 我想找路西法复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, like yourself, I want revenge on Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.94,0:17:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不止如此 我想见证你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more than that, I want to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,按自己的意愿重塑世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you remake the universe to your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说我的意愿更像灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told my tastes run towards the catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.16,0:17:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟说你最喜欢毁灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters say you are all about destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所谓的「毁灭」\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they call "Destruction"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称之为整修\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call renovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我的计划来 不是上帝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My blueprints. Not God's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你独特的方式来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do things the way you would have done them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有你什么事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where do you fit into that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮上忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你提供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provide you with information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦兄弟和路西法的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the troublesome brothers and Lucifer …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.15,0:18:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他们的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}their plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然这是出于我的自身利益考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if it is born out of my own self-interest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.27,0:18:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … I care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以跟我说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm someone you can talk with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.94,0:18:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confide in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有过这样的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you … Have you ever had that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用非得一个人 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't have to be, darlin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在做什么 似乎挺有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you're doing, it seems to be working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该试练一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should try a little test.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 喜欢你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Hey, I like your spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的组织永远欢迎进取者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always room for a go-getter in my organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我能指望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know I can count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.52,0:19:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也同意 还是我得去施施压\N{\fnArial\fs30}They on board, or we need to do a little wing-twisting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别考虑太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think about it too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道那句俗话 犹豫者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say … He who hesitates…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎成渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}disintegrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样太混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this is a dick move, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.36,0:19:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算以你的标准来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.46,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在不讲理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not being reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.79,0:19:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用讲理 我是国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to be reasonable. I'm the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去很棒啊 有锻炼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great. You been working out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.81,0:19:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我怒吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.57,0:20:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 伙计们 我觉得是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, fellas? I think that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是报复 女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a little payback, ladies and gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得阿玛拉姑姑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Auntie Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢你们二把刀的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}appreciated your little half-assed smiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh guess what … This …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是即将发生的事的一点预告\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a teeny taste of what's to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.05,0:21:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的专长是能派上用场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}my expertise is gonna come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上帝知道接下来会如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause God knows what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}God doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.84,0:22:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我们都知道她心情不好时\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-So now we all just saw what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,会发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she's in a bad mood,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然她从时间之初就一直没高兴过\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, apparently, she's been in since the dawn of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她刚刚动了动小指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she just rattled heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把天堂搅得一团乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a flick of her pinkie finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还看不清现实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a big enough dose of reality for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在争什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we arguing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道他得回到笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know that he has to go back in the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.81,0:22:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 等时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, when it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.26,0:22:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿玛拉是更要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara's the big picture here now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.83,0:22:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, in order to take her out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得把约书亚的号角给路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has got to have the Horn of Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干掉她 我们干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does her, we do him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 温家兄弟准备干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well? What are the Winchesters preparing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.13,0:22:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓得不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paralyzed with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着你是挺有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're actually handy to have around.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.29,0:23:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 时间不多了 你同不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, ticktock. You with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.93,0:23:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的论点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crux of your dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}is your contention that Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能使用号角对付阿玛拉的人 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}can use the Horn to beat Amara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.01,0:23:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有在你们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that scenario only works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个号角的情况下才行 而你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you actually possess said Horn, which you do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.95,0:23:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但是你有 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't. But you do, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly! I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有王牌 你们有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the high cards, and you have …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.55,0:23:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.89,0:23:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看 一张牌没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have a look … no cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.84,0:23:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的提议不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}My offer stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.29,0:23:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把路西法从笼子里放出来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we sprung Lucifer from the Cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:23:58.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,我们有罗威娜和《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had Rowena and the Book of the Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.33,0:24:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要这两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of which we will need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能把他关回笼子 而两样现在都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put him back in the Cage, both of which are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.12,0:24:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.54,0:24:16.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我死而复生了 费格斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.39,0:24:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.33,0:24:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.79,0:24:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 克劳力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way, where the hell is Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.21,0:24:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差不多都布置好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're essentially all set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是他逼我们这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, he's the one that boxed us into doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.88,0:24:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他至少也该 - 出现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'd think he'd have the decency to … - Show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.94,0:24:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没有诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because without the bait,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}well…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.96,0:25:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能称之为陷阱了嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}a trap really isn't a trap, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.75,0:25:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去不怎么特别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look like much, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.71,0:25:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一印象未必是准的 小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}First impressions can be deceiving, Moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 我曾觉得你无聊没劲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance, I once thought of you as dull and plodding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.82,0:25:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 这个比喻不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, never mind. Bad analogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你 我们依然觉得这主意不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, we still think this is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.64,0:25:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该利用路西法 不是杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be using Lucifer, not icing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你犹豫了 我就站这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll be standing right here should you hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,施予之手也可以拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hand that giveth can so quickly taketh away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.04,0:25:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we getteth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.01,0:25:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你刚刚说到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mummy, you were telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.08,0:25:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令人着迷的还魂故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}your fascinating tale of resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.79,0:25:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you never did say exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.55,0:25:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这段时间究竟去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you'd been this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.50,0:25:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样 费格斯 躲起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as you, Fergus. Hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.60,0:25:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果黑暗王子知道我还活着 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the Dark Prince knew I was alive, I wouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次别像上次那样搞小动作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No mucking about like last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.96,0:25:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,符文和圣火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warding and the holy fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.15,0:25:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能关大天使太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't keep an archangel but for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.10,0:25:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他会来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he shows up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:25:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he'll show.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.63,0:26:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太急着想干掉阿玛拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too hungry to take Amara out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.63,0:26:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们又有能干这个的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we've got the blaster to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.10,0:26:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.22,0:26:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤你是有东西想给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I summon you to make an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有可以用来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapon by which its bearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.33,0:26:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远击溃黑暗的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}can crush the Darkness forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.05,0:26:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.64,0:27:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的祈祷暗示我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your prayer implied that I'd be…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.97,0:27:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}joining the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.10,0:27:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怎么感觉不到热情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm just not feeling the warm and fuzzy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.78,0:27:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.90,0:27:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸亲自注入了能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powered up by Dad himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.29,0:27:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意 加上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that bad boy plus me …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.38,0:27:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确足以干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ought to take her out all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.83,0:27:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.50,0:27:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灭火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douse the flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.06,0:27:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.52,0:28:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.99,0:28:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.68,0:28:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.55,0:28:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.09,0:28:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's … What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.85,0:28:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.97,0:28:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a whole lot of time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.97,0:28:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.09,0:28:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.98,0:28:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he's got to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.02,0:28:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.57,0:28:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们刚刚差点套住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, you almost had me there for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这些邮购的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these mail-order spells …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.82,0:28:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在没有吹的那么厉害 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just not what they're cracked up to be, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.18,0:28:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 驱逐他 你得把路西法逐出体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, expel him! You got to kick Lucifer out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.96,0:28:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.21,0:29:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我觉得他对这种安排挺满意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I think he's happy with the arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.39,0:29:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟是他自己邀请我进来的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he did invite me in and all, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.51,0:29:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.07,0:29:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.13,0:29:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把武器交出来 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand over the weapon. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.02,0:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不咱们就等这符文失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we can just wait for this warding to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我自己来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.48,0:29:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.06,0:29:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it going to be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.47,0:30:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.38,0:30:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.26,0:30:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的朋友们 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear friends, it is going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.97,0:30:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be all right tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界已经终结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Crowley. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.99,0:30:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天谁生日来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, say, who was born today?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是温家的厨房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the Winchesters' kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.38,0:30:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在脑海里来这里打发时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come here in my mind to pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知什么原因 这里信号特别好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason, it has excellent reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 路西法对你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you? What has Lucifer done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.03,0:30:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他基本不怎么搭理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he mostly just leaves me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.19,0:30:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这儿等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just waiting here, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着跟黑暗开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the battle with the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.61,0:30:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还真给你洗脑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really got his hooks in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.61,0:30:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.29,0:30:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道外面发生什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.95,0:30:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟困住了那混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters have trapped the abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.77,0:30:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你驱逐他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that you can expel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.12,0:30:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们就能把他关回笼子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that they can put him back in the Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.93,0:30:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意听着可不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that doesn't sound like a very good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.83,0:30:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你现在的情况 你没资格指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your current state, you're in no position to judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.98,0:31:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我刚才看到的是迪恩 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. That was Dean I saw a minute ago, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.74,0:31:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我驱逐路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wants me to expel Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.79,0:31:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.93,0:31:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.03,0:31:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对现在的情况看法还挺客观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he may have a more objective view of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.48,0:31:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我是该驱逐他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就马上动手吧 省的夜长梦多\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's do it now before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.55,0:31:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It already is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.00,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.83,0:31:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想把我关回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to put me back in the Cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哪里都不会去的 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not going anywhere, and neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经去了好一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he's been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.66,0:31:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得现在什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do you think is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.85,0:31:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 也许小卡不愿意合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe Cass isn't willing to play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.69,0:31:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说过的 他想要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you said it yourself … he wanted this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.33,0:32:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩就不能干好点什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you people do anything right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.51,0:32:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里磨磨蹭蹭的 我们的时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whilst all this dithering goes on, we're losing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 符文快要失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … The warding's beginning to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.72,0:32:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 小卡 怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Cass. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.91,0:32:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个二流会计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You second rate bean counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.13,0:32:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 你们这样会打坏什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, you're gonna break something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.99,0:32:40.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（救我）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想坐上我的王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted my throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.60,0:32:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你密谋想篡位取代我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plotted to replace me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.55,0:32:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.34,0:32:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为有野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if ambition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,会装腔作势就等于威仪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and posturing were the same as majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.41,0:33:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.16,0:33:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.05,0:33:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱里所有人都看不起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in hell despises you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.56,0:33:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们完全明白你是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sees you for exactly what you are …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.81,0:33:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁都不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.56,0:33:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.33,0:33:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.22,0:33:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.16,0:33:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.77,0:33:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.41,0:33:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.93,0:33:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.27,0:33:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.07,0:33:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.37,0:33:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.14,0:33:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法对他的控制太强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's hold on him is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.91,0:34:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 火灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lads, the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,耍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.04,0:34:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以做你们的战士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I could have been your warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁需要你们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who needs ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.73,0:34:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力总在派对刚开始的时候离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just like Crowley to leave right when the party's getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.64,0:34:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.85,0:34:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管我从你俩身上得到了很多乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}As much as I get a giggle out of you two, and I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.57,0:34:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,每段关系 总有一个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there comes a time when every relationship has…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.27,0:34:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到头的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}run its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.06,0:34:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.99,0:35:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.14,0:35:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的侄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear nephew,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你变化真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}my, how you've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.55,0:35:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离我而去后 我就开始追踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tracking her when she left my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.04,0:35:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来被封印得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were safely sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.24,0:35:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会希望自己没被放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wish you'd stayed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.21,0:37:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你和我得好好地长谈一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you and I need to have a nice, long chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.96,0:37:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.32,0:37:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 罗威娜和克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So, Rowena and Crowley …
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.29,0:37:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是有其母必有其子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like mother, like son, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:38:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当情况不妙时 他俩真的都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both took exactly one split second to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.04,0:38:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞬间就跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when things started going south.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.37,0:38:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 给\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.43,0:38:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 罗威娜跑去阿玛拉那里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, wh-what's Rowena doing with Amara?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.47,0:38:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 她是想赌一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess … she's playing the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.85,0:38:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱路西法的大腿没抱住\N{\fnArial\fs30}When sucking up to Lucifer didn't work out,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.32,0:38:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她觉得把注压在阿玛拉身上胜算最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe she thought Amara was the best bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.75,0:38:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她又听说路西法真有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she heard Lucifer had a shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.84,0:38:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是又一次倒向了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so she switched horses again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.30,0:38:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也以为路西法有机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Lucifer had a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.35,0:38:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 大天使加上上帝之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, uh, archangel plus God power.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.10,0:38:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不能打败上帝的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't trump God sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.19,0:38:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如这玩意必须得由上帝的选民来使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the thing has to be used by God's chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.80,0:38:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么也许一个被炒鱿鱼的大天使并不够格\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe an archangel who got the boot doesn't qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.41,0:38:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.16,0:38:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,号角的神力已经被用尽了 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}horn's out of ammo, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.89,0:38:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们又回到了起点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.22,0:38:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.88,0:38:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我先前支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I came down on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.27,0:38:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让小卡去解决阿玛拉 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of wanting Cass to deal with Amara, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.45,0:38:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己也是这么想的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what he wanted, though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.43,0:38:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了 我们不是说好今后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, didn't we say that we were gonna swear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.00,0:38:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个人做出另一个人并不赞同的决定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting in the way when one person makes a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.72,0:38:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不再干涉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the other doesn't agree with?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.33,0:38:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们是说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we did say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.14,0:39:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.57,0:39:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.28,0:39:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的政策了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's our policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.89,0:39:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which sounds damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.09,0:39:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找到那个傻瓜带他回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's go find that idiot and bring him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.26,0:39:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.18,0:39:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.28,0:39:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你对我有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you have a major beef with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.17,0:39:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许想结果了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably want to finish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.32,0:39:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要考虑你的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you may want to rethink your position.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能会对你有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I could actually be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.69,0:39:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.90,0:39:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hadn't considered?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.27,0:39:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都跟上帝有账要算\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both have an ax to grind with God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.91,0:39:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know his soft spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.31,0:39:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没法同时对付我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't handle us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.96,0:39:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得我可能会相信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, for one moment, think that I would actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.90,0:40:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论出于什么理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider trusting you for anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.69,0:40:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信过你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did trust you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.60,0:40:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我哥哥合谋把我封印了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and my brother conspired to seal me away for eons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.06,0:40:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.65,0:40:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实可能对我有些用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be of some use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.47,0:40:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.54,0:40:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.40,0:40:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.04,0:40:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为上帝最喜爱的大儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}As God's favorite, his first son,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.65,0:40:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许是世间万物中唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}you may be the one thing in all of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然在乎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he still cares about,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.65,0:40:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一个能逼他现身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one thing that could finally make him show himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我就可以和他面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I can confront him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.40,0:40:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他承认他给我的委屈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can acknowledge the wrongs he's done me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.91,0:41:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he can witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.32,0:41:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他自己被毁灭前\N{\fnArial\fs30}the utter destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹他创造的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all his creation…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he himself is swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.48,0:41:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在等他出现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're expecting him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.31,0:41:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.16,0:41:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信他已经搭上了远走高飞的「末班车」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure he caught the last train out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.13,0:41:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.06,0:41:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就走着瞧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see, won't we?
